OL,3,GNEWSAUnauthorised traveller site told
OL,4,Ait cannot stay
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn unauthorised traveller site in
OL,7,FDerbyshire has been refused planning
OL,8,Fpermission to stay.
OL,10,FLandowner Sonny Sykes had applied for
OL,11,Fconsent for a site which three caravans
OL,12,Fmoved on to in July 2025 on a field off
OL,13,FFox Holes Lane in Tansley, near
OL,14,FMatlock.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
