OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAUnauthorised traveller site told
OL,4,Ait cannot stay
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Derbyshire Dales District Council
OL,7,Fplanning meeting on Tuesday ruled
OL,8,Fagainst allowing the camp of two
OL,9,Fpermanent and two temporary caravan
OL,10,Fpitches over its remote location on a
OL,11,Fnarrow lane, its impact on the
OL,12,Fcharacter of the area, and the site's
OL,13,Flack of drainage and waste facilities.
OL,15,FProposing the refusal, Tansley ward
OL,16,Fcouncillor David Hughes said: "We have
OL,17,Fto assess the plan as it is presented,
OL,18,Fnot what it could be to overcome
OL,19,Fobjections."
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
